rises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988370/extras/de131836d1a30cb5d478795557bdc6ec.poster.avif?t=1786063676\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988370/extras/de131836d1a30cb5d478795557bdc6ec.webm?t=1786063676\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988370/extras/de131836d1a30cb5d478795557bdc6ec.mp4?t=1786063676\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988370/extras/b392a49b0fa5689d01b98541fddeb02c.poster.avif?t=1786063676\" width=640 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988370/extras/b392a49b0fa5689d01b98541fddeb02c.webm?t=1786063676\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988370/extras/b392a49b0fa5689d01b98541fddeb02c.mp4?t=1786063676\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ready to float away?</p>",
